00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:28.120
MIKE MANDEL: What was that?

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:28.911
MIKE HAMBERG: Yeah.

00:08:28.911 --> 00:08:31.560
So we took a look at
where the Titanic sank,

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:35.780
and the hours surrounding
it, and did a visualization

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.919
