00:27:57.440 --> 00:28:00.369
copying across the workbook,
and then you can take advantage

00:28:00.369 --> 00:28:02.660
of this thing, and then
customize it if you so desire--

00:28:02.660 --> 00:28:03.570
that kind of stuff.

00:28:03.570 --> 00:28:05.390
And it's super
super, super nice.

00:28:05.390 --> 00:28:06.590
FRANCESC CAMPOY: In
