00:28:08.756 --> 00:28:09.720
Copying it is cool.

00:28:09.720 --> 00:28:12.600
I think that the cool thing is
that this is just framework,

00:28:12.600 --> 00:28:14.210
and you can build
on top of this,

00:28:14.210 --> 00:28:15.960
and adapt it to
whatever project you're

00:28:15.960 --> 00:28:17.680
using, which is pretty amazing.

00:28:17.680 --> 00:28:19.060
Like, if you know
how to use SQL,

00:28:19.060 --> 00:28:20.810
you know how to use
BigQuery, and now, you

00:28:20.810 --> 00:28:24.950
