present it in a super cute way.

00:28:30.260 --> 00:28:33.720
Cloud Data Studio-- it allows
you to expose information

00:28:33.720 --> 00:28:36.320
in a very, very
visual way, meaning

00:28:36.320 --> 00:28:39.110
that, even though you're
working with hard data,

00:28:39.110 --> 00:28:42.290
you're able to present it so
anyone can understand what's

00:28:42.290 --> 00:28:43.940
going on, which is
very, very nice.

00:28:43.940 --> 00:28:45.481
MIKE MANDEL: In the
article, it links

